{"id":"pe-inspect.1","n":"pe-inspect","s":"1","src":{"r":{"pkg":"python3-virt-firmware","ver":"24.11-1.el9_6.1","repo":"AppStream","url":"https://dl.rockylinux.org/vault/rocky/9.6/AppStream/x86_64/os/Packages/p/python3-virt-firmware-24.11-1.el9_6.1.noarch.rpm","path":"/usr/share/man/man1/pe-inspect.1.gz","sha256":"2292ff2321f911b4d57953c6ef8d74ed7be1dcbde2cb0808d8434a6d9256a543","date":"November 2024","origin":"pe-inspect 24.11"}},"nopt":{"r":4},"desc":"manual page for pe-inspect 24.11","r":[["NAME","<p>pe-inspect - manual page for pe-inspect 24.11</p>"],["DESCRIPTION","<p>usage: pe-inspect [-h] [-x] [-v] [--findcert] [FILES ...]</p> <p>Print informations about PE/EFI binaries.</p>  <h3>positional arguments:</h3> <dl><dt>FILES</dt><dd>List of PE files to dump</dd></dl>   <h3>options:</h3> <dl><dt data-o=\"\" data-g=\"options:\"><b>-h</b>, <b>--help</b></dt><dd>show this help message and exit</dd><dt data-o=\"\" data-g=\"options:\"><b>-x</b>, <b>--extract</b></dt><dd>also extract signatures and certificates</dd><dt data-o=\"\" data-g=\"options:\"><b>-v</b>, <b>--verbose</b></dt><dd>print more certificate details</dd><dt data-o=\"\" data-g=\"options:\"><b>--findcert</b>, <b>--find-cert</b></dt><dd>check EFI databases for certs</dd></dl>"],["AUTHOR","<p>Gerd Hoffmann &lt;kraxel@redhat.com&gt;</p>"]]}